{"sections":[{"slug":"Nisnevich景","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Nisnevich景"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“Nisnevich <span lang=\"zh\">景</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“Nisnevich 景”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">考虑</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Noether概形","text":"Noether <span lang=\"zh\">概形</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的范畴上的如下覆盖结构</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">一族态射</span> $\\{p_i\\colon V_i \\to U\\}$ <span lang=\"zh\">为覆盖当且仅当任何域点</span> $\\operatorname{spec}k\\to U$ <span lang=\"zh\">都提升到某个</span> $V_i$. <span lang=\"zh\">该覆盖结构生成的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Grothendieck拓扑","text":"Grothendieck <span lang=\"zh\">拓扑</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">称为</span> Nisnevich <span lang=\"zh\">拓扑</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $S$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> Noether <span lang=\"zh\">概形</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">考虑</span> $S$ <span lang=\"zh\">上有限型光滑概形的范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">其配备</span> Nisnevich <span lang=\"zh\">拓扑构成的景称为</span> $S$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> Nisnevich <span lang=\"zh\">景</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}